records.full_description:
You learn to read disturbances in air.

You have Advantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks to notice:

moving creatures that displace air within 30 feet;

hidden creatures that are not behind Total Cover and are moving within 30 feet;

incoming arrows, darts, needles, thrown weapons, or similar projectiles;

gas, smoke, or pressure changes;

whether a sealed door has air moving beneath or around it.

Wind-Sense does not reveal creatures that do not move, creatures behind airtight barriers, or creatures concealed by superior stealth, illusion, or Void techniques without an opposed check.

