records.full_description:
Prerequisite: CL 12+

Action Type: Bonus Action
Factory Combat Bucket: bonus_action
Factory Routing: combat_action_row

Duration: 1 minute

Cost: Expend Martial Focus

Use Limit: Once per short rest

For the duration:

increase all movement Speeds by 20 feet;

ignore nonmagical difficult terrain;

stand from Prone without spending movement;

move through allied spaces normally;

climb ordinary surfaces without a check;

once per turn after moving at least 20 feet, regain Martial Focus;

once per turn when a hostile creature misses you, move 5 feet without provoking Opportunity Attacks. Court of Ten Thousand Steps ends early if you become Incapacitated.

