records.full_description:
“The enemy decided to strike. The cultivator had already stepped beyond the meaning of the attack.”

Classification: Secret Athletics Inheritance

Prerequisite: CL 17+, Flash Step, Heaven-Treading Body, hidden movement scripture

Action Type: Reaction
Factory Combat Bucket: reaction
Factory Routing: combat_action_row

Trigger: You are targeted by an attack, trapped by an area effect, or would fail a Dexterity saving throw

Cost: Expend Martial Focus

Use Limit: Once per week

Move up to your Speed.

This movement:

occurs before the triggering effect resolves;

does not provoke Opportunity Attacks;

may cross air, walls, water, hostile spaces, and fragile surfaces;

may use Flash Step once during the movement without spending additional Focus;

cannot cross sealed barriers or Dimensional Locks. After movement:

if you are outside the triggering attack’s reach, line, or area, the effect misses you;

otherwise, gain Advantage on the triggering Dexterity saving throw or impose Disadvantage on the triggering attack roll. Until the end of your next turn:

hold Martial Focus even after expending it;

increase all movement Speeds by 30 feet;

ignore ordinary Restrained and Grappled effects caused by physical contact. ### OPTIONAL ATHLETICS CULTIVATION VARIANTS An Athletics cultivation variant changes what the practitioner believes motion requires.

These variants are mutually exclusive.

