Prerequisite: Hammer, CL 5+

When Hammer creates an Impact Collision, choose one:

the shoved creature makes a Constitution save or becomes Dazed until the start of its next turn;

the secondary creature makes a Strength save or falls Prone;

increase collision damage by your Proficiency Bonus;

break one ordinary unsecured object involved in the collision.

Dazed: This is a Brute-specific state, not a core 2024 condition. A Dazed creature cannot take Reactions and has Disadvantage on its next attack roll before the state ends.

