Prerequisite: CL 10+

Action Type: Action
Factory Combat Bucket: action
Factory Routing: combat_action_row

Cost: Expend Martial Focus

Grab a solid surface within reach and attempt to destroy it.

The surface must be:

a wall;

door;

floor;

barrier section;

comparable solid structure.

It cannot be:

loose dirt;

liquid;

iron or harder material without a specific enabling feature;

an artifact;

a Formation core;

a Realm-defining structure.

Make:

DC 10 Strength check

Success: Tear out a section approximately your own size.

Against a surface thicker than 1 foot, destroy only 1 foot of thickness per use.

