Cost: Expend Martial Focus.

Move up to 10 feet. This movement:

requires no Action or Reaction;

may occur even when it is not your turn;

does not provoke Opportunity Attacks;

must end in a legal unoccupied space you can reach.

You may use Footwork after an attack is declared against you but before its attack roll is made. If you do, the triggering attack roll has Disadvantage. If your movement makes you an illegal target for the triggering attack, the attack misses instead.

