records.full_description:
Action Type: Bonus Action
Factory Combat Bucket: bonus_action
Factory Routing: combat_action_row

Area: 60-foot Emanation from you

Duration: Concentration, up to 1 minute

Cost: 3 CP

You establish a tide court. The battlefield gains a spiritual slope toward your chosen sea.

While the Domain lasts:

you may maintain one additional Basin or Current;

Water Lash may originate from any point inside the Domain;

once on each of your turns, you may use Return the Flow without using a Bonus Action;

hostile creatures treat your Basins and Currents as Difficult Terrain;

allies of your choice ignore Difficult Terrain from your Water effects;

when a hostile creature fails a saving throw against one of your Water effects, you may move it 10 feet into a legal space;

when you create a Basin, you may choose two forms from Shape Current instead of one, such as Mist plus Pressure or Cleansing plus Flow.

The Domain does not fill the entire area with physical water unless you use talents that create floodwater.

