records.full_description:
You may perform a 10-minute rite at a clean Water Source or Cleansing Basin, spending 3 CP.

For 24 hours, the site becomes a Sacred Spring. A creature that spends 10 minutes washing, drinking, or meditating there gains one benefit:

remove one level of Exhaustion caused by thirst, heat, smoke, forced march, or environmental hardship;

gain Advantage on the next saving throw against Poisoned or disease before the next long rest;

recover additional Hit Points equal to your CL during a short rest;

cleanse mundane filth, ash, smoke residue, or spiritual grime visible to ordinary senses.

A Sacred Spring cannot remove curses, resurrect the dead, replace Life, or produce infinite economic water. Long-term springs require project rules, maintenance, and local spiritual geography.

