When you apply this Slam, choose one ordinary ongoing supernatural effect affecting the Grappled creature that you can perceive.

Make a Cultivation Check against:

10 + effect rank

For an ordinary spell, use spell level as effect rank.

For another effect without a listed rank, the GM assigns a rank based on its source and strength.

Successful Check: Suppress the effect until the start of your next turn.Successful Check by 5 or More: Dispel the effect instead when appropriate.

If the target is a summoned creature, the effect that summoned it may be suppressed until the start of your next turn.

Cultivation-Suppressing Grip does not automatically dispel:

Domains;

Secret Inheritances;

artifacts;

Formation cores;

Realm-defining transformations;

permanent karmic bonds.

