Prerequisite: CL 17+, Court of the Closed Distance, World-Pinning Clinch, hidden restraint scripture

Action Type: Action
Factory Combat Bucket: action
Factory Routing: combat_action_row

Range: Reach

Cost: Expend Martial Focus

Use Limit: Once per week

Choose one creature within reach.

It makes a Strength or Dexterity saving throw, choosing which, against your Wrestling Save DC.

Failed Save: Until the end of your next turn:

the target becomes Grappled and Restrained;

ordinary size limits do not apply;

the target cannot teleport, travel between planes, or become Incorporeal;

the target cannot be moved away from you unless you permit it;

apply up to three different Slam talents you know immediately;

the target has Disadvantage on saving throws and checks made to escape this hold.

At the end of each of its turns, the target repeats the saving throw, ending the effect on a success.

Successful Initial Save: The target cannot take Reactions until the start of your next turn.

The Hold Heaven Could Not Escape does not automatically overcome:

artifacts;

Formation cores;

Domains;

Secret Inheritances;

Realm-defining transformations;

major narrative entities beyond the scope of ordinary combat.

Those may require a contested Cultivation Check or a specific narrative condition.

